- `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16` + `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17` define app `versionCode = 1` and `versionName = "0.1.0"`.
- `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43` passes `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` to `AppShellScreen`; `BuildConfig.VERSION_CODE` is not currently passed at that call site — `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:41`, `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`.
